    "duration": 6.72,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Did you get those cinnamon rolls? No. By the time I got there, they'd sold out. Let's go earlier next time.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "by-the-time-dialogue-02",
    "sourceHash": "3b570fc7a66651b3532bb2586ceb54b76c1a27d4ae3c1db633b7b527fedef3d4",
    "duration": 6.88,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Should I pick up dinner on my way home? No need. It'll be ready by the time you get home. Great. I'll be home around seven.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "by-the-time-dialogue-03",
    "sourceHash": "756d1a4d03f651a2b664f1025710d9c2dbcfef82dccf98288547a649d6106023",
    "duration": 6.56,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Did we miss much? The movie had already started by the time we sat down. I'll ask you about the beginning later.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "by-the-time-dialogue-04",
    "sourceHash": "a0349a20a9db6ec4a2de52255fd57453a6c004f4eb239dce7bdffa779b7996c8",
    "duration": 6.88,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Will these clothes be dry by the time we leave? Not those jeans. They're still pretty wet. I'll wear something else then.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "by-the-time-dialogue-05",
    "sourceHash": "10d803d05b76cad52c96e615326ced13a0b865a2c82385c428c82da873e4134c",
    "duration": 6.56,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Did you get to say good night to her? No, she was asleep by the time I got upstairs. She had a busy day.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "by-the-time-dialogue-06",
    "sourceHash": "6420ccf33cb2e62b702a2a9970074c4a1a824a817831a6b07bcd63523709d6bc",
    "duration": 7.04,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Did you get caught in the rain? Luckily, it had stopped by the time I left the store. You picked the right time to go shopping.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "by-the-time-dialogue-07",
    "sourceHash": "d502615d2a0b92eb54a3c06abb9754c6bc403e54f556755c7dbe3325458ac6ba",
    "duration": 6.96,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "He'll be starving by the time we get there. I've got some crackers in my bag. You're a lifesaver. Can I have a few?",
    "textSimilarity": 0.9822,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "by-the-time-dialogue-08",
    "sourceHash": "d0bdfc9150db7617c571de2d77e75fc47aae420e49ad8ee65476c2fb38a8728b",
    "duration": 7.76,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "I'll come over after work and help clean up. Thanks, but we'll probably be done by the time you arrive. Then I'll bring dessert instead.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "by-the-time-dialogue-09",
    "sourceHash": "318ce06a32889da7c2ca87560c0a2d63b33d8bab8ef5adc415ffe6631c523cbd",
    "duration": 7.04,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Can I use your charger for a bit? Sure, your phone should be charged by the time we leave. Perfect, mine's almost dead.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "by-the-time-dialogue-10",
    "sourceHash": "34632ba8d7b72cdc8253fe267dff779bcb5cc2192fc92913446ba9217ab68051",
    "duration": 7.04,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "I can't find you. Where are you? I was already outside by the time you called. Stay there. I'll come out now.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-01",
    "sourceHash": "62c317205ec7d142a8d9cb3e097de9462fdad3fb6821b8dd036e66e1a91a3c45",
    "duration": 5.28,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Are we still having the picnic tomorrow? It depends on whether it rains. Let's check again tonight.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-02",
    "sourceHash": "02030a8d13fc4df072023f12ba24aef2c9dd5c6ed90d3440f3829c4248195e76",
    "duration": 7.28,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Have you decided what to order? I'm trying to decide whether to get tea or coffee. The coffee here is really good.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-03",
    "sourceHash": "579e885ce8281db378edad237622cd2e3a33a6cff8d5b1b323bf84da3fd68fe1",
    "duration": 6.96,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Do you know whether Sam is coming? Not yet. He said he'd text me after work. Okay. I'll save him a seat for now.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-04",
    "sourceHash": "d8ceccf6ea8fd3901132c3c806872243f8bfbf7ecf61b4d7829108bc46596993",
    "duration": 7.12,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Should we walk over to that bakery? Let's check whether it's open first. Good idea. It's closed on some weekdays.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-05",
    "sourceHash": "1cca7dfcf81e151c22f34aced0883037fe71a6b512a571739663f8de7e479d7d",
    "duration": 7.28,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Why are you staring at your suitcase? I can't decide whether to take a jacket. Take the light one. It gets cold at night.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-06",
    "sourceHash": "1075d1a3181a009b46c70df12d0d0ced9b406d8d87019af6afb03669facbe49f",
    "duration": 7.68,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Have you tried this sauce before? No. I can't tell whether it's spicy or just sweet. Try a tiny bit first.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-07",
    "sourceHash": "0943e058db9f6db8b798d19009dc451b3c40b86a479f519b575ac1cb3624bb71",
    "duration": 7.68,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "I might not be able to come on Saturday. That's okay. I'm going whether you come or not. Have fun. I'll join you if I can.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-08",
    "sourceHash": "e8c871462a9b5feebcb1ca70222afb4946070c2fb88dc687d6d7a81fcbd1eac5",
    "duration": 7.52,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Have you decided whether to walk or take the bus? Let's walk. We've got plenty of time. Okay, we can stop for coffee on the way.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-09",
    "sourceHash": "1378062b5be9b0441179874c8243856e4b1a8a719930be231d0e9fd1d310a80f",
    "duration": 7.12,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "I booked online, but I didn't get an email. Call and ask whether your booking went through. I'll do that before we leave.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "whether-dialogue-10",
    "sourceHash": "36fdf7fee50ac6989101d35e50c6658acb20d3d076452948c2190834f253a60e",
    "duration": 6.32,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Does this look too formal? I'm not sure whether we're supposed to dress up. I'll ask the others what they're wearing.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-01",
    "sourceHash": "4a36f1a96def5662c557641af48555151aec7c6431865330f35e0b6ebf4aab0d",
    "duration": 6.56,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Now that everyone's here, shall we order? Yes, please. I'm starving. Let's get a couple of pizzas to share.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-02",
    "sourceHash": "a2e561237342bedf845a5239d62e91da39eff5ff15e4e9656e71aca9583cffb6",
    "duration": 6.8,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "How are you liking the new place? Now that I've unpacked, it finally feels like home. I'll have to come over sometime.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-03",
    "sourceHash": "218958ac70569be107a3db94eca2a73fccb7f8ded6b8d1e934d84061da0d1ec3",
    "duration": 6.0,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Now that the rain stopped, let's go for a walk. Give me a minute to find my shoes. I'll wait by the door.",
    "textSimilarity": 0.9935,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-04",
    "sourceHash": "22878ef16c2e638156fe124e3d26674d0233689927e8efd1f452af84eec46738",
    "duration": 6.8,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "You look relieved. I can finally relax now that the presentation's over. Let's get something nice for dinner.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-05",
    "sourceHash": "fcf69dde062aa6cf3f896b837daf5334ab4a5bc2af01baf42a67ed43b23e5c8a",
    "duration": 7.2,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "I still can't believe we're neighbors. Now that you live nearby, we should hang out more. Definitely. Are you free this weekend?",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-06",
    "sourceHash": "284a29c412351badb14e269a0091b486069d39febf9ae80fa9deaabcebf472e8",
    "duration": 7.36,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Are the new glasses helping? Yeah, now that I can see properly, reading's much easier. They look great on you too.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-07",
    "sourceHash": "9126bab3b74540a633059bfbe48c1c1836b0872a50805cd6ed2fdb18d662004f",
    "duration": 7.04,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Now that we have a car, we can visit your parents more often. They love that. How about next Sunday? I'll call them tonight.",
    "textSimilarity": 0.9948,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-08",
    "sourceHash": "3b7b2acc74ba9ebb6782e3e4505d661165f99707ecaa9ccdd97dcc7b038a8c83",
    "duration": 6.96,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Do you want to grab a coffee? Sure. Now that class is over, I've got an hour free. There's a quiet place across the street.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-09",
    "sourceHash": "0e47540783bf013f5097d909f58b10cc6a5595aae41e19b6bd12f1ab5ea56ae5",
    "duration": 7.12,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Now that it's cooled down, do you want to try a piece? Yes, it smells amazing. I'll cut you a big slice.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "now-that-dialogue-10",
    "sourceHash": "eb94f2f5cfb42cec81fb2370b450b4119f8be5cd479bd02ad6a639ca5c872c99",
    "duration": 7.84,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Are you still carrying her to school? Not anymore. Now that she's older, she wants to walk. She'll be asking to go on her own next.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
