    "duration": 5.92,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "Why are you packing lunch tonight? So that I can sleep a little longer tomorrow. I should do that too.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
    "id": "so-that-dialogue-06",
    "sourceHash": "f392f4109dd8b0ad90b81d2498db45565a37ec8346324ce88829868ab511be7d",
    "duration": 7.44,
    "method": "offline-faster-whisper-base.en",
    "transcript": "I'll turn up the brightness so that you can see the photo. That's better. Is that your new puppy? Yeah, we brought him home yesterday.",
    "textSimilarity": 1.0,
    "targetExpressionHeard": true,
    "needsReview": false
  },
  {
